{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "timeline",
  "title": "时间线",
  "description": "用于纵向展示条目、带粘性标签与滚动渐变动画的时间线组件。",
  "category": "misc",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "aceternity-ui"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "containerClass",
      "type": "HTMLAttributes[\"class\"]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "时间线容器的额外 CSS 类。",
      "default": "\"\""
    },
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "HTMLAttributes[\"class\"]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "其他样式的额外 CSS 类。",
      "default": "\"\""
    },
    {
      "name": "items",
      "type": "{\n    id: string;\n    label: string;\n  }[]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "时间线条目列表，每项包含 ID 与标签。",
      "default": "() => []"
    },
    {
      "name": "title",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "时间线部分的标题。",
      "default": "\"\""
    },
    {
      "name": "description",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "显示在标题下方的描述文字。",
      "default": "\"\""
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "path": "app/components/reborn/examples/timeline/TimelineDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "版本发布历史、更新日志的分段展示。",
    "公司里程碑、项目进程的长页叙事，需要标签随滚动粘性停留。",
    "每个节点需要自定义富内容（图文混排）的时间线。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "只需内容侧边的滚动光束装饰，改用 tracing-beam。",
    "展示多步骤加载状态，改用 multi-step-loader。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用，依赖 motion-v。",
    "items 元素需含 id 与 label 字段；每个条目的内容通过以 item.id 命名的动态具名插槽传入（#[item.id]）。",
    "title 与 description 显示在时间线头部，containerClass 控制外层容器样式。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [
    "motion-v"
  ],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add timeline"
  },
  "sourceRefs": {
    "web": [
